RES osdtriplet
! Glass catalogs are AGF files (Library/LIBGLA, plus LIBGLA/ in each
! search-path folder -- this test's TESTCAT.AGF lives in test/data/LIBGLA)
GLASSP
GLASSP TESTCAT
! glass data by name through a catalog alias (glass-aliases.txt: SCH2000 is
! now SCHOTT), and searched in every catalog
GLASSP SCH2000 N-BK7
GLASSP GLAK ZSILICON
! by glass code in a vendor file that writes no codes (made from nd/vd), for
! a glass whose Extended 3 coefficients wrap onto continuation lines
GLASSP HIKARI 487703
! catalog glasses on a lens: catalog alias, user catalog, a name without a
! catalog (the catalogs after catalog-order.txt follow alphabetically), lower
! case, and an old Ohara name that used to contain a space
GLA S1 N-BK7_SCH2000
GLA S3 ZBK7_TESTCAT
GLA S5 zbk7
RTG ALL
GLA S3 S-FSL5_OHARA
GLA S5 j-fk5
RTG ALL
! glass alias: a plain old Schott name means its N- glass; with the catalog
! named it is the old glass itself
GLA S3 SK16
GLA S5 SK16_SCHOTT
RTG ALL
! out of the glass's wavelength range -> warning, indices 1.0
GLA S3 ZNARROW_TESTCAT
RTG ALL
! Herzberger formula: user catalog against SPECIAL.AGF, in the IR
WL 2000 3000 4000
GLA S1 SILICON
GLA S3 ZSILICON_TESTCAT
RTG ALL
GLA S1 DIAMOND
GLA S3 ZDIAMOND_TESTCAT
RTG ALL
! closest catalog glasses to a model glass
RES osdtriplet
GLA S3 1.5168:64.17
FINDGLAS SCH2000 3 4
FINDGLAS 3 3
FINDGLAS NOCAT 3 3
! special materials: SPECIAL.AGF formulas and *.ZTG table glasses, the old
! MATL catalog and material names as aliases (glass-aliases.txt), and a
! glass code written without its dot (a model glass)
RES osdtriplet
GLASSP SPECIAL ACRYLIC
GLASSP MATL CAF2
GLA S1 ACRYLIC
GLA S3 517642
GLA S5 POLYCARB
RTG ALL
WL 3000 4000 5000
GLA S1 IRTRAN4
GLA S3 GERMSC_MATL
GLA S5 KBR
RTG ALL
! ten wavelengths: a catalog glass gets its index at wavelength 10 too
WL 450 480 500 520 550 580 600 620 650 680
GLA S1 SILICA
GLA S3 N-BK7
NDEX2 ALL
! catalog search order (CSO): F8 is in both SCHOTT and HIKARI (whose F8 data
! stops at 0.70 um, so GLA warns); CSO alone restores the default
RES osdtriplet
CSO ?
CSO hikari sch2000
GLA S3 F8
CSO NOSUCH
CSO
GLA S5 F8
RTG ALL
! catalog listings: indices at the lens wavelengths (GLI), transmittance
! data (TLI), other data (MLI), and all of it for one glass (GPR)
GLI TESTCAT
TLI TESTCAT
MLI TESTCAT
GPR SCHOTT N-BK7
GPR SPECIAL ACRYLIC
GLI NOPE
! CODE V import keeps a glass's catalog (ZBK7_TESTCAT, F2_HIKARI,
! SILICA_SPECIAL; N-BK7_HIKARI is not a Hikari glass, so the search order
! finds it); a catalog word at lens input; a save/restore and a .seq round
! trip keep each catalog (HIKARI F8 is also a SCHOTT glass)
CV2PRG glasscat.seq
U L
CHG 3
TESTCAT ZDIAMOND
EOS
RTG ALL
RES osdtriplet
WL 500 550 600
GLA S1 F8_HIKARI
GLA S3 POLYCARBONATE
SAV glassrt
RES glassrt
RTG ALL
ZOA2CV glassrt.seq
CV2PRG glassrt.seq
RTG ALL
! a catalog name longer than the 8-character legacy word (LONGCATALOG.AGF):
! the cut word LONGCATA means the one catalog it begins
RES osdtriplet
GLA S3 ZLONG_LONGCATALOG
U L
CHG 5
LONGCATA ZLONG
EOS
SAV longrt
RES longrt
GLASSP LONGCATALOG ZLONG
NDEX ALL
